          "speaker": "clerk",
          "text": "お出かけの間、お荷物をお預かりしましょうか？",
          "voice": "Kore",
          "speed": "normal",
          "ambience": false,
          "screen": null,
          "audio": "hotel-check-out.luggage.p3.mp3"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "要不要幫你把行李寄到機場",
            "zh-Hans": "要不要帮你把行李寄到机场",
            "en": "Shall we send your bags to the airport"
          },
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "要不要幫你叫計程車",
            "zh-Hans": "要不要帮你叫出租车",
            "en": "Shall we call you a taxi"
          },
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "要不要幫你寄放行李",
            "zh-Hans": "要不要帮你寄存行李",
            "en": "Shall we keep your bags"
          },
          "correct": true
        }
      ],
      "response": {
        "ja": "お願いします／大丈夫です",
        "audio": "hotel-check-out.luggage.response.mp3",
        "voice": "Orus"
      },
      "explanation": {
        "zh-Hant": "「お預かり」是幫你保管。退房後還想出去逛，可以把行李寄放在櫃台，通常會拿到一張號碼牌，回來時出示。",
        "zh-Hans": "「お預かり」是帮你保管。退房后还想出去逛，可以把行李寄存在前台，通常会拿到一张号码牌，回来时出示。",
        "en": "お預かり means they keep it for you. If you want to go out after check-out, you can leave your bags at the desk. You usually get a tag to show when you come back."
      },
      "wordIds": [
        "suitcase"
      ]
    }
